','Bottom-Up Parsing & LR Parsers'),(861,126,'Which class of LR parsers merges states with identical LR(0) item cores, producing a compact table equal in size to SLR while providing superior parsing power?','Operator Precedence Parser','Recursive Descent Parser','LALR(1) Parser (Look-Ahead LR)','Non-deterministic Finite Automaton','C','Medium','Bottom-Up Parsing & LR Parsers'),(862,126,'Under what precise structural condition does an LR parsing table experience a Reduce-Reduce (R/R) conflict in state I?','When two distinct complete production items A -> alpha. and B -> beta. both propose reductions on the same lookahead symbol','When the input string contains two consecutive addition operators','When a non-terminal has more than three production alternatives','When the lexical analyzer returns an unrecognized variable name','A','Hard','Bottom-Up Parsing & LR Parsers'),(863,127,'What characterizes an S-attributed Syntax-Directed Definition (SDD)?','Every attribute is synthesized and computed exclusively from the attribute values of child nodes in the parse tree','Attributes can only be evaluated from right to left across sister nodes','It only applies to source code written in assembly language','Inherited attributes are passed down without mathematical operations','A','Easy','Syntax Directed Translation & Intermediate Code'),(864,127,'How many address fields are explicitly stored in each record of a \"Quadruple\" representation of Three-Address Code?','2 fields (operator and operand)','3 fields (operator, operand1, operand2)','4 fields (operator, argument1, argument2, and result)','8 fields for 64-bit CPU registers','C','Medium','Syntax Directed Translation & Intermediate Code'),(865,127,'In Three-Address Code generation for Boolean expressions, what does the technique of \"Backpatching\" accomplish?','It translates all while loops into unconditional goto statements before parsing','It passes lists of unresolved jump instructions as synthesized attributes and fills 